# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
# Ignore build output but keep the directory itself: web/embed.go does
# //go:embed all:dist, which is a hard compile error when dist/ is missing,
# so a fresh clone must still have the directory present.
dist/*
!dist/.gitkeep
dist-ssr
*.local

